<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-22T07:48:32.124Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:48:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have stepped up attacks on Saudi infrastructure, striking King Fahd airport in Dammam and attempting drone strikes on Saudi oil fields, killing two people in an intercepted drone incident. In response, US diplomats were ordered to leave Saudi Arabia as the threat from Houthi attacks grew. Egypt’s president said Egypt will defend Saudi territory but will not attack Yemen. Yemen government forces reported killing or wounding 285 Houthis in 835 strikes. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8zR1cwOHBqbWE1eVVxUlJheDVHLS1BWnhhS19DcktCMEZkTFU4UVpFTm8xVXloNXpBUzUwN3VMTmV5TzlHaVRWRG16S3lHaFNhXzJaYzc4YjhkazZfM2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNdDNBT1lDRldBUTNwM040VzhsS1ptVTNiZzR6ZkhKZmhRRUd1NU5xc3hEc0JkUEswTVB6WVhqd0xSNEk2cS1uWkV3MW40bi1MbmRTYzZya2hmdWplSDZGUTFaQldFVzJZMHRLNGNjVGxULWNnWk5ReUI2dlpYRk14d3J0M2NJTmM0UHg0UUthWnFrX2otUWJUd2VnOUp6QVNtbWhZdkJUajhqZjBpUHVpZTJB?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQM21Ia2s5aEhHdThWNmNHSTJhN1N2VUhNRlZ5ODQ3bHExTFNWYmJYTkdiMXVpQk5McTQ4aENzS3F4dDI2N3hwNXpSZlNPTHJzZF9YamJBcGU2RTE3eHFVRDl3QTc3TG9zcTg0NG1rYk4zLUE4TjlreWNXOXRmYWliOVRNWEhQTVVOUjQ5dTNRUEh4WjV1SWxtOGVSQzJCODcwWURDUHFQUWU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNOTVkWGE1OXR6WGRqTTc1SldmLTkzaktHOERSTmo3ZldRbU1tS2ZXQ2ZIbnRJcWdGN3VaejNNRTM1RV9pcEdqQkdBMC04S2QxVk5GUGNqY0NFTDcyOXYxVVNuVHZub0xpQ1M2aEV5eTJ3Z0ZJclJTNHc4VVBWOGtJRDVTcTJUOWw4VGZET1F2eHFQeXB0Q2lyRzM4SzdyLVdfQjNKUXVpbTc4V0t